==Other Appearances==
==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
During the "[[Perils of Mount Hylia]]" [[Quest]], [[King Rhoam]] is making plans to climb to the peak of Mount Hylia, but he needs to protect himself from the cold with warm [[Material]]s.<ref name="AoC Gallery"/> Using the Materials, King Rhoam is able to reach the mountain's peak, where he overlooks the [[Hyrule]] and comes up with a new defensive measure.<ref name="AoC Gallery 2"/>
{{Noncanon|End}}

==={{AoI|-}}===
{{Main|Hyrule Castle Outskirts}}
Mount Hylia appears as part of the [[Hyrule Castle Outskirts]] in the [[Scenario]] "[[Growing Suspicion]]", where [[Rauru]] battles [[Shade]]s that appear to distract him away from [[Hyrule Castle]] so [[Ganondorf]] can acquire [[Sonia]]'s [[Secret Stone of Time]].

